title: "Steering Vectors for CoT Faithfulness & Verbosity"
abstract: >-
  Training and evaluating steering vectors that increase chain-of-thought
  monitorability (verbosity and cue acknowledgment) in reasoning models,
  evaluated with faithfulness/verbosity metrics on BBH, GPQA, and MMLU.
